      "text": "She said a criminal gang had built it."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 12.1649,
      "end_seconds": 14.7321,
      "text": "She asked Nayib Bukele to destroy the building—and"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 14.8412,
      "end_seconds": 15.5321,
      "text": "got that reply."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 15.8719,
      "end_seconds": 18.2683,
      "text": "Other users began posting coordinates in the comments."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 18.4138,
      "end_seconds": 21.2196,
      "text": "By then, Salvadoran troops were already in Haiti."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 21.4378,
      "end_seconds": 23.8009,
      "text": "Four days after his reply, Bukele posted a"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 23.9828,
